{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The magnitudes of the sides of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, as shown, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/02203dfba67fc28462a71ea9ab3d7047bd9a123c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\le b\\le a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />. Through interior point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and the vertices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, lines are drawn meeting the opposite sides in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1090530ae883b627e090bfb5e450ef796febca40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c71f19552a05ee5e2b31e94aff3fb986884bf31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B&#39;$\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b798193cb94562989018728e1151587c618655b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"16\" />, respectively. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/6/d969fa1389514bdae4095bb260bae27f0f92bb4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=AA&#39;+BB&#39;+CC&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"175\" height=\"15\" />. Then, for all positions of point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is less than:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/4/af42a27e05f3f551c7cbedc9ec4d055374cb947e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2a+b\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }2a+c\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2b+c\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }a+2b\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"503\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6ebd1e0356cfe09c0d9b5459d6f1542657bb5891.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b8175dd073e666965c2dd3700b5b55a1823d0505.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import math;  pair A = (0,0), B = (1,3), C = (5,0), P = (1.5,1);  pair X = extension(B,C,A,P), Y = extension(A,C,B,P), Z = extension(A,B,C,P);  draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(A--X); draw(B--Y); draw(C--Z); dot(P); dot(A); dot(B); dot(C); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,dir(210)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,dir(90)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,dir(-30)); label(&quot;$A&#39;$&quot;,X,dir(-100)); label(&quot;$B&#39;$&quot;,Y,dir(65)); label(&quot;$C&#39;$&quot;,Z,dir(20)); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,P,dir(70)); label(&quot;$a$&quot;,X,dir(80)); label(&quot;$b$&quot;,Y,dir(-90)); label(&quot;$c$&quot;,Z,dir(110)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"168\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that in any triangle, longer sides oppose larger angles.  Therefore, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/6/1b667bf64542ecfdadf4078da301f0aedb916af5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\leq b \\leq a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/e/91e4555b9072b79da887c4e49663b46451c51b08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB \\leq \\angle ABC \\leq \\angle BAC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"217\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>By the exterior angle theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/1/ee14922d82f848c4f0a97de3a0334f1091b420d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AA&#39;C &gt; \\angle ABC \\geq \\angle ACB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03da496e3f8a0e53190b0b68a6adcf80279c15b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AA&#39; &lt; AC = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a28337f966d7ca4d2d661b8d46bf507ab1cd47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BB&#39;C &gt; \\angle BAC \\geq \\angle BCA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"222\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/3/65375f2ee4219ce9f5d2527f24d1e268e3601e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BB&#39; &lt; BC = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/c/3ac705f694f467d5e61b30b81786735281d46ee9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CC&#39;B &gt; \\angle BAC \\geq \\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"222\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/c/cac2294c0c3c747dcee1405fe1bfd055a90df596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CC&#39; &lt; BC = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/2/862c4eecfe849054f6a490d4f52b0973b217dfd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = AA&#39; + BB&#39; + CC&#39; &lt; b + a + a = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2a + b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"393\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This question has a unique correct answer, so if choice (X) is always less than or equal to choice (Y), then (X) must be incorrect, as otherwise (Y) would also be correct.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/5/2a553e4d6df006bdfa55e905404053ab978f1c41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\leq b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e5d6b967c590e3b07f66f0dadf281d11553e4d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + c \\leq 2a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"124\" height=\"17\" />, so (B) is incorrect.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/0418bbd33f58076209c3f2f3148348cfb351521b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\leq a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/e/95e9a861d071cf4b3513235b54f5b44cbed0247e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b + c \\leq 2a + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" />, so (C) is incorrect.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/0418bbd33f58076209c3f2f3148348cfb351521b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\leq a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/2/852d38944490839e0c71412c0536fa32898f00c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + a + b \\leq a + a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/56153dcd77a62666dbd8aabe0a9ad63478fcf38d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 2b \\leq 2a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"124\" height=\"17\" />.  So (D) is incorrect.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bd53b97ce4df4ef5922f6256077b69ac5f40cdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\leq a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/5/705811e6f877d09deaf40eaab593f86a40b88c8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c + a + b \\leq a + a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/9/d5903d9f4a430475e93b85a657402a63d31a354b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c \\leq 2a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"145\" height=\"17\" />.  So (E) is incorrect.\n</p><p>Therefore, by process of elimination <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd4fb6ebd6be8444b208cd24ee76fcefd3ab7fe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2a + b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" /> is correct.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017164531\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 318/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2984/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 196/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7745/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.257      1 -total\n 63.91%    9.750      1 Template:AHSME_40p_box\n 34.00%    5.188      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12508:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017164531 and revision id 290931. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}